---
title: sd MF-02c: Candidate Responds to Consent & Attribution Is Granted
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor CA as Candidate
  participant FE as Web App (HRConnect-FE)
  participant API as SubmissionConsentEndpoints
  participant H as RespondSubmissionConsentHandler
  participant P as SubmissionAcceptancePolicy
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant AI as Mf03ScoringTrigger
  CA->>FE: Open consent link & select Confirm or Decline
  FE->>API: POST /api/v1/submission-consents/respond (token, decision)
  API->>H: Send(RespondSubmissionConsentCommand)
  H->>DB: Verify TokenHash, expiry timestamp & Job still ACTIVE
  alt Decision == DECLINE or Token Expired
    H->>DB: Update Consent -> DECLINED/EXPIRED, Submission -> CONSENT_REJECTED
    H-->>API: Return ConsentResponseDto
    API-->>FE: 200 OK (Consent Declined / Expired)
  else Decision == CONFIRM
    H->>P: AcceptAsync(submission) & GrantAttributionAsync()
    P->>DB: Insert Application (SUBMITTED) & Attribution (ACTIVE) to Affiliate
    H->>AI: TriggerScoringAsync(applicationId) -> AiMatchResult PENDING
    H-->>API: Return ConsentResponseDto (ApplicationId)
    API-->>FE: 200 OK (Application Created & Attributed)
  end
